{
  "_doc": "Pikes Peak International Raceway on Lake Murray v4's engine (ledger 0078): engine lm-v4, the intake from tracks/pikes-peak, Lake Murray's assembler and fold weld, finer ground on the banked stretches, the traced kerbs when committed, the bespoke dressing, engine-july's prep / export, the gates + edge_report. 0.2.0 (ledger 0085): three layouts on one road kn5 (the oval, the road course, the infield), each with its own spawn kn5 (AC_* nodes) and AI line; the laps stitched by the author step race_laps.",
